    "## 9. Model 2 — Pretrained MiniLM (Zero-Shot)\n",
    "\n",
    "Uses `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` — pretrained, completely frozen, no fine-tuning — to embed the prompt and each option, then scores each option by the cosine similarity between its embedding and the prompt's embedding.\n",
