    "This is the L1 \"pretrained model\" requirement, and it's deliberately used zero-shot so it demonstrates what general-purpose semantic representations get us *without* any task-specific training, as a contrast to Models 1 and 3.\n",
    "\n",
    "Each option is scored independently against the prompt embedding; the five similarity scores are then softmax-normalized into probabilities for the ensemble."
